Third-party material
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Published data

  The bundled cable definitions (cablexsec/cables/) and the comparison data
  in validation/paper_data/ are transcribed or digitised from the published
  sources cited in each file (for example Menard and Cartraud, Marine
  Structures 91 (2023) 103465; Witz, Marine Structures 9 (1996) 885-904; Saevik,
  Computers and Structures 89 (2011) 2273-2291; Gjosteen et al., Marine Structures 111 (2027)
  104189; Janocha et al. (2024) for IEA Wind Task 49; CIGRE TB 880). The
  numerical values are facts reported in those publications; the
  publications themselves are not redistributed. Cite the original sources
  when you use these data.

Global analysis results

  validation/paper_data/global_demo/ and the floating-wind figure data are
  reduced results of global time-domain simulations made by the maintainers
  with a commercial global solver. No solver software, model or simulation
  file is included.

